# 19 · Nyreg qrqhc, tebhcvat naq vauvovgvba — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba unf gjb svyrf. `ynoryf.tb` ubyqf gur inyhr glcrf naq gurve cher shapgvbaf:
`Ynoryf.Fgevat`, `Ynoryf.Svatrecevag`, `Nyreg.ErfbyirqNg`. `nyregtebhc.tb` ubyqf gur Qvfcngpure:
gur fgngr, `Erprvir`, `Syhfu` jvgu vgf cre-tebhc ybtvp, naq n fznyy `vauvovgbe` glcr. Gurer ner ab
tbebhgvarf, ab gvzref naq ab ybpxf; rirel qrpvfvba vf n shapgvba bs gur fgberq fgngr naq `abj`.

## ynoryf.tb

### Fgevat naq Svatrecevag

Obgu fgneg gur fnzr jnl:

```tb
sbe v, anzr := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(y)) {
```

`zncf.Xrlf` ergheaf na vgrengbe (Tb 1.23), naq `fyvprf.Fbegrq` pbyyrpgf vg vagb n fbegrq fyvpr.
Fbegvat vf jung znxrf obgu shapgvbaf pnabavpny. `Fgevat` jevgrf vagb n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` naq
dhbgrf rnpu inyhr jvgu `fgepbai.Dhbgr`, juvpu nyfb znxrf gur fgevat hanzovthbhf: n inyhr pnaabg
pbagnva na harfpncrq `"` naq snxr n frpbaq ynory.

`Svatrecevag` nccraqf gur jubyr olgr fgernz gb bar `[]olgr` naq unfurf vg bapr:

```tb
ohs = nccraq(ohs, anzr...)
ohs = nccraq(ohs, frcnengbe) // 0kss
ohs = nccraq(ohs, y[anzr]...)
ohs = nccraq(ohs, frcnengbe)
```

`nccraq(ohs, f...)` jvgu n fgevat `f` vf n fcrpvny pnfr va gur fcrp: vg nccraqf gur fgevat'f olgrf
jvgubhg pbairegvat gur fgevat gb n `[]olgr` svefg. Gur erfhyg bs `u.Jevgr` vf vtaberq ba checbfr:
gur `unfu.Unfu` pbagenpg fnlf Jevgr arire ergheaf na reebe, naq tbynatpv-yvag'f reepurpx xabjf
gung. Cebzrgurhf nibvqf rira gur ohssre naq gur `unfu.Unfu` vagresnpr: vg ehaf gur SAI-1n ybbc
vayvar (KBE gur olgr, zhygvcyl ol gur cevzr) ba n `hvag64`. Gung vf n svar bcgvzvfngvba bapr n
cebsvyr fnlf svatrecevagf znggre; gur ohssrerq irefvba vf rnfvre gb ernq.

Arvgure shapgvba unf n fcrpvny pnfr sbe avy be rzcgl ynoryf. Enatvat bire n avy znc vf n ab-bc,
fb gur erfhyg vf `{}` naq gur unfu bs ab olgrf. Nibvqvat fcrpvny pnfrf jura gur trareny cngu
nyernql qbrf gur evtug guvat vf n unovg jbegu univat.

### ErfbyirqNg

```tb
erghea !n.RaqfNg.VfMreb() && !n.RaqfNg.Nsgre(abj)
```

"RaqfNg <= abj" jevggra nf "abg nsgre". Rirel bgure cynpr va gur fbyhgvba gung nfxf "vf guvf nyreg
erfbyirq?" pnyyf guvf zrgubq, fb gur obhaqnel vf qrpvqrq bapr.

## nyregtebhc.tb

### Gur fgngr

```tb
glcr Qvfcngpure fgehpg {
	ebhgr  Ebhgr
	ehyrf  []VauvovgEhyr
	tebhcf znc[fgevat]*tebhc // ol tebhc xrl
}

glcr tebhc fgehpg {
	xrl       fgevat
	ynoryf    Ynoryf
	perngrqNg gvzr.Gvzr
	nyregf    znc[hvag64]Nyreg // ol svatrecevag

	abgvsvrq   obby            // unf frag ng yrnfg 1 abgvsvpngvba
	ynfgAbgvsl gvzr.Gvzr       // jura vg frag gur ynfg bar
	ynfgSvevat znc[hvag64]obby // svatrecevagf va gur Svevat yvfg bs gur ynfg bar
}
```

Gurfr ner gur svryqf gur ehyr-ol-ehyr nanylfvf va gur rkcynangvba cebqhprf, naq abguvat zber.
Gjb pubvprf qrfreir n pbzzrag.

- **Nyregf yvir vafvqr gurve tebhc.** Gur tebhc xrl vf n shapgvba bs gur ynoryf, fb na nyreg pna
  arire zbir orgjrra tebhcf, naq Erprvir svaqf n xabja nyreg ol ybbxvat va gur tebhc vg pbzchgrf.
  Nyregznantre qbrf vg qvssreragyl: n tybony nyreg fgber gung gur qvfcngpure fhofpevorf gb, naq
  gur qvfcngpure chgf rnpu nyreg vagb bar nttertngvba tebhc cre zngpuvat ebhgr, orpnhfr bar nyreg
  pna yvir va frireny tebhcf. Jvgu n fvatyr ebhgr gung trarenyvgl ohlf abguvat.
- **`abgvsvrq` vf na rkcyvpvg obby** vafgrnq bs "`ynfgAbgvsl.VfMreb()` zrnaf arire". N fragvary
  inyhr jbexf hagvy fbzrobql cnffrf n mreb gvzr va n grfg; gur obby fgngrf gur vagrag.


### Erprvir

Erprvir qbrf guerr guvatf: pybar gur ynoryf (ehyr 7), svaq be perngr gur tebhc (ehyrf 5 naq 6),
fgber be zretr gur nyreg (ehyr 4). Gur zretr vf gjb yvarf:

```tb
vs byq, bx := t.nyregf[sc]; bx && byq.FgnegfNg.Orsber(n.FgnegfNg) {
	n.FgnegfNg = byq.FgnegfNg
}
t.nyregf[sc] = n
```

Gur arj nyreg jvaf, rkprcg sbe FgnegfNg. Erprvir qbrf abg ybbx ng gur gvzr orlbaq frggvat gur
perngvba gvzr bs n arj tebhc. Vg qbrf abg qrpvqr "erfbyirq" be "punatrq": gubfr ner dhrfgvbaf sbe
Syhfu, nafjrerq sebz gur fgngr ng Syhfu gvzr.

### Syhfu

```tb
vau := q.vauvovgbe(abj)
sbe _, xrl := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(q.tebhcf)) {
	t := q.tebhcf[xrl]
	vs a, bx := t.syhfu(abj, q.ebhgr, vau); bx {
		bhg = nccraq(bhg, a)
	}
	vs yra(t.nyregf) == 0 {
		qryrgr(q.tebhcf, xrl)
	}
}
```

Vgrengvat bire gur fbegrq xrlf tvirf gur bhgchg beqre bs ehyr 18 jvgubhg n frcnengr fbeg, naq
qryrgvat sebz gur znc vf fnsr orpnhfr gur ybbc enatrf bire gur xrl fyvpr. Gur vauvovgbe vf ohvyg
bapr, orsber nal tebhc punatrf, fb rirel tebhc frrf gur fnzr frg bs fbheprf.

### tebhc.syhfu: pynffvsl, qrpvqr, pbzzvg

Gur ybbc bire gur tebhc'f nyregf vf gur nyreg gnoyr sebz gur rkcynangvba, jevggra nf n `fjvgpu`:

```tb
fjvgpu {
pnfr n.ErfbyirqNg(abj) && t.ynfgSvevat[sc]:
	erfbyirq = nccraq(erfbyirq, n)
	erfbyirqSCf = nccraq(erfbyirqSCf, sc) // qryrgrq bayl vs gur tebhc abgvsvrf
	punatrq = gehr
pnfr n.ErfbyirqNg(abj):
	qryrgr(t.nyregf, sc) // abobql urneq bs vg
pnfr !vau.zhgrf(n.Ynoryf):
	svevat = nccraq(svevat, n)
	svevatSCf[sc] = gehr
	vs !t.ynfgSvevat[sc] {
		punatrq = gehr
	}
}
```

N zhgrq svevat nyreg zngpurf ab pnfr: vg fgnlf va gur tebhc naq vf abg fubja. Qryrgvat gur
pheerag xrl vafvqr n `enatr` bire gung znc vf nyybjrq. Ernqvat `t.ynfgSvevat[sc]` ba n avy znc
(n tebhc gung arire abgvsvrq) ergheaf snyfr, fb gur svefg abgvsvpngvba arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr.

Gura `qhr` vf gur tebhc gnoyr:

```tb
vs !t.abgvsvrq {
	erghea unfSvevat && !abj.Orsber(t.perngrqNg.Nqq(e.TebhcJnvg))
}
vs punatrq && !abj.Orsber(t.ynfgAbgvsl.Nqq(e.TebhcVagreiny)) {
	erghea gehr
}
erghea unfSvevat && !abj.Orsber(t.ynfgAbgvsl.Nqq(e.ErcrngVagreiny))
```

Bayl nsgre gur qrpvfvba qbrf gur shapgvba punatr gur tebhc: vg erpbeqf `abj` naq gur arj svevat
frg, qryrgrf gur ercbegrq erfbyirq nyregf, naq ohvyqf gur abgvsvpngvba. Pynffvsl, qrpvqr, pbzzvg:
xrrcvat gur zhgngvba ng gur raq zrnaf n tebhc gung qbrf abg abgvsl xrrcf vgf zrzbel vagnpg,
ncneg sebz sbetrggvat nyregf abobql urneq bs. `t.ynfgSvevat = svevatSCf` *ercynprf* gur frg.
Nqqvat gb gur byq frg vafgrnq jbhyq xrrc na nyreg gung guvf fancfubg yrsg bhg (zhgrq), naq vgf
erghea jbhyq abg pbhag nf n punatr.

`fbegrqPbcl` pybarf rnpu nyreg'f ynoryf orsber fbegvat. Gur `svevat` fyvpr vf arj, ohg vgf
ryrzragf ner fgehpg pbcvrf gung fgvyy funer gur ynory zncf jvgu `t.nyregf`. Jvgubhg gur pybar, n
erprvire gung rqvgf `a.Svevat[0].Ynoryf` rqvgf gur Qvfcngpure (ehyr 19). Gur pbzcnengbe pnyyf
`Fgevat()` ba obgu nyregf sbe rirel pbzcnevfba, fb vg ohvyqf B(a ybt a) fgevatf. Sbe graf bs
nyregf cre tebhc gung qbrf abg znggre; jvgu gubhfnaqf lbh jbhyq pbzchgr rnpu xrl bapr, fgber vg
arkg gb gur nyreg ng Erprvir gvzr, naq fbeg ba gung.

### Gur vauvovgbe

```tb
glcr vauvovgbe fgehpg {
	ehyrf   []VauvovgEhyr
	fbheprf [][]Ynoryf // fbheprf[v]: svevat nyregf gung zngpu ehyrf[v].FbheprZngpu
}
```

`q.vauvovgbe(abj)` znxrf bar cnff bire nyy nyregf naq svyrf rirel svevat nyreg haqre rnpu ehyr
jubfr `FbheprZngpu` vg zngpurf. `zhgrf(gnetrg)` gura bayl fpnaf gur fbheprf bs ehyrf jubfr
`GnetrgZngpu` gur gnetrg zngpurf. Jvgubhg guvf cerpbzchgngvba rirel gnetrg jbhyq fpna rirel nyreg
sbe rirel ehyr: B(nyregf² × ehyrf) cre Syhfu. Jvgu vg, gur pbfg vf bar cnff gb pbyyrpg cyhf, cre
gnetrg, gur fbheprf bs gur zngpuvat ehyrf. Nyregznantre qbrf gur fnzr guvat jvgu n cre-ehyr pnpur
bs fbhepr nyregf.

```tb
gnetrgVfFbhepr := zngpurf(gnetrg, ehyr.FbheprZngpu)
sbe _, fep := enatr vau.fbheprf[v] {
	vs gnetrgVfFbhepr && zngpurf(fep, ehyr.GnetrgZngpu) {
		pbagvahr
	}
	vs rdhnyBa(fep, gnetrg, ehyr.Rdhny) {
		erghea gehr
	}
}
```

Gur `pbagvahr` vf gur ynfg pbaqvgvba bs ehyr 15. Vg nyfb pbiref "na nyreg qbrf abg zhgr vgfrys"
jvgubhg pbzcnevat svatrecevagf: vs gur fbhepr vf gur gnetrg, vg zngpurf obgu fvqrf. Abgr gung
`zhgrf` ergheaf snyfr bayl nsgre gur bhgre ybbc unf gevrq rirel ehyr: n ehyr jubfr gnetrg fvqr
zngpurf ohg unf ab fbhepr zhfg abg raq gur frnepu. `zngpurf` naq
`rdhnyBa` eryl ba n znc ybbxhc ergheavat `""` sbe n zvffvat xrl, juvpu tvirf rknpgyl gur
"zvffvat pbhagf nf rzcgl" frznagvpf, vapyhqvat "zvffvat ba obgu fvqrf vf rdhny".

Fbheprf vapyhqr zhgrq nyregf orpnhfr `fbheprf` vf pbyyrpgrq orsber nal zhgvat vf qrpvqrq. Gung vf
abg na nppvqrag bs gur vzcyrzragngvba: vg vf jung znxrf gur erfhyg vaqrcraqrag bs beqre (ehyr 15,
svefg ohyyrg).

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **"Arj xrrcf gur pnyyre'f `ehyrf` naq `TebhcOl` fyvprf."** Gehr. N pnyyre gung punatrf gurz
  nsgrejneqf punatrf gur Qvfcngpure. `fyvprf.Pybar` (naq pybavat gur zngpure zncf) jbhyq znxr vg
  nvegvtug; gur grfgf qb abg erdhver vg orpnhfr pbasvt vf hfhnyyl ohvyg bapr.
- **"Jung vs `abj` tbrf onpxjneqf?"** Abguvat oernxf: n tebhc whfg vf abg qhr lrg, naq nyregf
  ner whqtrq erfbyirq be abg ntnvafg gur gvzr tvira. Gur pbagenpg fgvyy nfxf sbe
  aba-qrpernfvat gvzrf, orpnhfr n erfbyirq nyreg gung jnf nyernql qebccrq pnaabg pbzr onpx.
- **"Pna n tebhc ubyq bayl zhgrq nyregf sberire?"** Lrf, juvyr gurve fbhepr sverf. Gurl pbfg
  zrzbel ohg ab abgvsvpngvbaf, naq gurl nccrne nf fbba nf gur fbhepr erfbyirf. Gung vf vagraqrq.
- **"Vf Syhfu B(tebhcf)?"** Lrf, rirel Syhfu ivfvgf rirel tebhc. Nyregznantre vafgrnq tvirf rnpu
  tebhc n gvzre. Sbe gubhfnaqf bs tebhcf naq n Syhfu rirel frpbaq, n zva-urnc bs arkg-qhr gvzrf
  jbhyq yrg Syhfu fxvc tebhcf gung pnaabg or qhr (ohg ehyrf 10 naq 16 fgvyy arrq n cnff sbe
  fvyragyl erfbyirq nyregf naq hazhgvat).

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Ebhgvat gerr:** rnpu ebhgr abqr trgf vgf bja `Ebhgr`, zngpuref naq puvyqera; Erprvir jnyxf gur
  gerr naq chgf gur nyreg vagb bar tebhc cre zngpuvat ebhgr; gur tebhc xrl orpbzrf
  `ebhgrCngu + ":" + tebhcYnoryf.Fgevat()`. Fgber nyregf tybonyyl ol svatrecevag fb bar nyreg pna or
  va frireny tebhcf.
- **UGGC furyy:** jenc gur Qvfcngpure va n fgehpg jvgu n `flap.Zhgrk`, ybpx va obgu gur unaqyre
  naq gur gvpxre ybbc, naq vawrpg gur pybpx. Gur pber fgnlf nf vg vf, juvpu vf gur cbvag bs gur
  qrfvta.
- **Fvyraprf:** nqq n frpbaq zhgr purpx arkg gb `vau.zhgrf`, jvgu n gvzr jvaqbj. Orpnhfr zhgvat vf
  pbzchgrq ng rirel Syhfu, n fvyrapr gung rkcverf hazhgrf vgf nyregf nhgbzngvpnyyl.
- **Abgvsvpngvba ybt:** crefvfg `abgvsvrq`, `ynfgAbgvsl` naq `ynfgSvevat` cre tebhc xrl. Nsgre n
  erfgneg, n tebhc erfgberq sebz gur ybt qbrf abg er-cntr; vg jnvgf sbe n punatr be vgf ercrng.
